  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/main/website/static/img/logo.png\" width=\"180\" />\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">Chess-tui 2.8.1</h1>\n\n## What's Changed\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Support ghostty terminal for kitty graphics (#367) ([`12fd6c4`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/12fd6c48b397344fd049875fb43c591045bf5423))\n\n### Chore\n\n- **deps:** Bump log from 0.4.34 to 0.4.35 (#372) ([`33106d7`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/33106d7b37acc96155c5a1511d526cf9447132d1))\n- Bump 2.8.1 ([`67ecd88`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/67ecd8869bb0caeaf098a7ea19a9bfe2e2a514e8))\n\n### Features\n\n- Ask for confirmation before the b key returns to the home screen (#371) ([`44a3433`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/44a34335514ab76b9722b69f29e4fff00fb91d83))\n\n\n## New Contributors\n* @cazeaux made their first contribution in https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/pull/367\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/compare/2.8.0...2.8.1\n",
